      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = torch.transpose(x, 1, 2)。",
        "交换张量的维度1和维度2，输出形状为 [128, 512, 32, 256]。",
        "保留数据元素不变，仅改变内存视图或进行等效数据重排。",
        "支持非连续 stride，处理时需考虑实际内存布局。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "custom_selu",
      "parameters": [
        {
          "name": "x",
          "kind": "tensor",
          "dtype": "torch.float32",
          "device": "cuda",
          "shape": "[128, 512, 32, 256]",
          "layout": "supports strides",
          "optional": false,
          "nullable": false
        }
      ],
      "returns": {
        "type": "tensor",
        "dtype": "torch.float32",
        "device": "cuda",
        "shape": "[128, 512, 32, 256]"
      },
      "semantics": [
        "对应参考语句 x = F.selu(x)。",
        "对输入张量逐元素应用 SELU 激活函数：scale * x if x > 0 else scale * alpha * (exp(x) - 1)，其中 scale=1.0507009873554804934193349852946, alpha=1.6732632423543772848170429916717。",
        "输出形状与输入相同，dtype 不变。",
        "如果输入是非连续 stride，需要先处理布局。"
      ]
    }
  ],
